  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Called from the router for an account-closure intent (n8n Spec Sec. 10). Runs the shared Account Lockout Handler first. Single-holder accounts close immediately afterward with no consent step. Multi-holder accounts require every other holder's phone-OTP-confirmed approval within a fixed decision window; any rejection or timeout escalates to manual review and is never auto-resolved either way. Execution and final statement generation happen only via Python services."
  },
